# Raw art binaries excluded to stay within GitHub's free tier.
# These live only on local disk / in the backup-full-history tag.
# .meta files are deliberately NOT ignored, so asset GUIDs survive
# and references still resolve if the art is restored later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

